          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On August 22, 2010, at 2:40 a.m., several people observed from their homes the silent passage of orange-colored glowing balls forming a triangle, all moving in the same direction (S-NE) on a straight trajectory. These balls eventually disappeared after turning a brighter red. One of the witnesses filmed part of the observation. Following a gendarmerie deposition from a person who read an article on this subject in the press and in accordance with the information provided in the gendarmerie report, this is a confirmed case of lantern releases during a private party in the neighboring commune.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "2e78d2898b014354c43c38c49cbe4b3f1a5df1a7cff2b7193afcac2bfc026426"
